# To Complete - A To-Do List Web App

A modern and responsive To-Do List application built using **HTML, CSS, and JavaScript**. This project helps users manage daily tasks with a clean glassmorphism-inspired user interface and interactive task management features.

## Features

* Add new tasks dynamically
* Remove completed or unwanted tasks
* Mark tasks as completed with strike-through effect
* Smooth hover animations and transitions
* Responsive centered layout
* Modern glassmorphism UI design
* Background image with blur effects
* Beginner-friendly pure frontend project

## Technologies Used

* HTML5
* CSS3
* JavaScript (Vanilla JS)

## UI Highlights

* Professional modern styling
* Soft shadows and rounded corners
* Interactive buttons and animations
* Frosted glass blur container effect

## How It Works

1. Enter a task in the input field
2. Click the **Add Task** button
3. Click on a task to mark it as completed
4. Click the **Remove** button to delete a task

